          "source_section": "Definition",
          "quote": "A **tensor-invertible object** $D$ is an object for which some object $E$ satisfies $D\\otimes E\\cong\\mathbf 1$ and $E\\otimes D\\cong\\mathbf 1$.",
          "uses": [
